🔍 Project Goal:
Falls are the 2nd leading cause of unintentional injury deaths globally, especially affecting the elderly. Our team (Obada Sultan ,Ahmad Al Habab,ادم فريحات) designed an ML solution to detect falls in real-time using wearable sensors, enabling faster emergency response.

⚙ Tech Stack:
Sensors: Accelerometer & gyroscope data
Model: Random Forest classifier
Dataset: 11,771 samples from the Unimib-SHAR Kaggle dataset
Tools: Python, Scikit-learn, SMOTE for class balancing

📊 Results:
Achieved 98% accuracy in fall detection with near-perfect recall for "fall" events! Our model minimizes false alarms while ensuring critical falls trigger immediate alerts.

